    "task_description": "Please check which devices are connected in the living room, then run a full health diagnosis on the main lock, living room light, living room AC, and living room TV for any issues. After that, turn on the living room light to 70% brightness, lock the main lock using PIN 2026, and then send me a high-priority app alert with a remediation summary and save it as an `iot_security_run` backup under `/projects`.",
