      "query": "For default_user, please check which devices are connected in the living_room, then run a full health diagnosis for all_issues on the main lock lock_main, the living room light light_living, the living room AC, and the living room TV. After that, set light_living to on at 70% brightness, and lock lock_main with PIN 2026 so its state is lock. Then send a high-priority app alert titled IoT Remediation Summary with the remediation summary, and save it as the backup iot_security_run in /projects.",
